      "created_at": "2026-02-04T00:36:41.385Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, if I create a request for quotation and submit it, the emails never arrive.  If I open the specific request for quotation and click the “ … ” menu and click Email, then Send, the emails arrive in about 1 minute or less.  Which is fine. Seems to me that when I hit submit, shouldn’t the system automatically send the request?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/516af183cf7d63360107166c2d96c57a9d98fbaf.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/516af183cf7d63360107166c2d96c57a9d98fbaf\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/1/516af183cf7d63360107166c2d96c57a9d98fbaf.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bCfNCr4f6Xl1qrUQMNGQirGJODt\" width=\"509\" height=\"189\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">509×189 11.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>All the supplier information is correct along with the items.  The Send email box is checked.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5cf8201707bf603e62b5beb2b584d670bfc0d31c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5cf8201707bf603e62b5beb2b584d670bfc0d31c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5cf8201707bf603e62b5beb2b584d670bfc0d31c_2_690x169.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dgrx4mXo4fjG6e4WlX6UfKkj65C\" width=\"690\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/c/5cf8201707bf603e62b5beb2b584d670bfc0d31c_2_690x169.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5cf8201707bf603e62b5beb2b584d670bfc0d31c.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/c/5cf8201707bf603e62b5beb2b584d670bfc0d31c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">999×245 18.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I have one email account setup, and it works.  It says in Email Account &gt; (<a href=\"mailto:myemail@whatever.com\">myemail@whatever.com</a>):  Default Sending and Inbox.  I assume this means it’s the default for everything.  Although there is one thing that puzzles me and I tried to google it but no real response.  It says the Status for the account is Default sending and… but when you hover over the blue text it says, “Document is in draft state”.  What does this mean?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/d/5d5acfa863c182317efd9a19518d4035d92f8d47.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5d5acfa863c182317efd9a19518d4035d92f8d47\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/d/5d5acfa863c182317efd9a19518d4035d92f8d47_2_690x153.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"djQXWgJeF7NHvUA8cafhw8ChwXB\" width=\"690\" height=\"153\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/d/5d5acfa863c182317efd9a19518d4035d92f8d47_2_690x153.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/d/5d5acfa863c182317efd9a19518d4035d92f8d47_2_1035x229.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/d/5d5acfa863c182317efd9a19518d4035d92f8d47.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1370×304 33.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>RQ Jobs appear to say that it should’ve went out?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/1/c1bee96112127a1c8907b591931a04affa030b69.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c1bee96112127a1c8907b591931a04affa030b69\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/1/c1bee96112127a1c8907b591931a04affa030b69_2_690x349.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rDXb2AEFWHdbKiZHOzOdDl7zuwV\" width=\"690\" height=\"349\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/1/c1bee96112127a1c8907b591931a04affa030b69_2_690x349.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/1/c1bee96112127a1c8907b591931a04affa030b69_2_1035x523.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/1/c1bee96112127a1c8907b591931a04affa030b69.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1249×633 88.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Schedule Jobs all say Complete</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4cd9b90f5a2a2d24fea88dfa6d6e36d0016baa21.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4cd9b90f5a2a2d24fea88dfa6d6e36d0016baa21\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4cd9b90f5a2a2d24fea88dfa6d6e36d0016baa21_2_690x391.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"aXQKVvrfsLcQHUrj0r2rpiycBq1\" width=\"690\" height=\"391\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4cd9b90f5a2a2d24fea88dfa6d6e36d0016baa21_2_690x391.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/c/4cd9b90f5a2a2d24fea88dfa6d6e36d0016baa21_2_1035x586.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/c/4cd9b90f5a2a2d24fea88dfa6d6e36d0016baa21.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F8F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1056×599 74.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>No Error Logs generated</p>\n<p>I feel like I am so close to having this work!</p>",
