      "name": "RIch",
      "created_at": "2026-02-05T16:18:21.008Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for that <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/a/0a565c926971a2741621be8eff81dd78cb891519.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0a565c926971a2741621be8eff81dd78cb891519\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/a/0a565c926971a2741621be8eff81dd78cb891519_2_690x314.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1trNP22yfh4wYAP5KuHzlNvFrL3\" width=\"690\" height=\"314\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/a/0a565c926971a2741621be8eff81dd78cb891519_2_690x314.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/a/0a565c926971a2741621be8eff81dd78cb891519_2_1035x471.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/a/0a565c926971a2741621be8eff81dd78cb891519.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1114×507 44.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>It doesn’t show any hung jobs.  I tried sending a new quotation and it never queued.  I sent a manual email, and it queued instantly and sent pretty quickly after that.  Seems like when the initial request is created the job is not queued up.  Is this a setting I need to check?</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
