      "id": 493548,
      "username": "richbcph",
      "name": "RIch",
      "created_at": "2026-02-05T23:58:47.192Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I found this <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/email-not-send-after-request-for-quotation-submitted/142203/7\">post</a> and realized I needed to select the email template before sending.  Once I did that it works.</p>\n<p>Anyone else with this issue make sure you select the Email Template and confirm the suppliers all have emails associated.</p>\n<p>All fixed.  Figured it was something I hadn’t done.  Thanks again all <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
